title: Start
---
<<declare $visits = 0>>
<<if $visits == 0>>
    Ada: This is your first time here. #line:9a0001
<<elseif $visits < 3>>
    Ada: A handful of visits, no more. #line:9a0002
    <<if $visits == 2>>
        Ada: The second of them. #line:9a0003
    <<else>>
        Ada: Not the second. #line:9a0004
    <<endif>>
<<else>>
    Ada: You know this room as well as I do. #line:9a0005
<<endif>>
Ada: After the block. #line:9a0006
-> Stay and read. #line:9o0001
    <<if $gateOpen>>
        Ada: The gate is open. #line:9a0007
    <<endif>>
-> Leave now. #line:9o0002
